lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯调整AI战略重心：WorkBuddy取代元宝成为核心办公智能体</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta旗下视频编辑应用Edits推出AI创作助手与桌面版</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic布局美国数据中心并拟寻求谷歌母公司财务支持</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌计划联合三星代工第十代TPU芯片“冰鱼”，预计2028年量产</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ec057ed108dc0bef8f280e3f12035eb9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正计划携手三星共同生产其第十代人工智能专用芯片，代号为“冰鱼”（Icefish）。面对全球芯片产能紧张的挑战，谷歌采取了分工制造策略：核心计算引擎将交由台积电采用1.4纳米制程生产，而内存输入输出裸片则由三星采用2纳米制程代工。该芯片目前处于设计阶段，谷歌已联合联发科共同参与研发，预计最早于2028年实现量产。此举旨在通过多元化代工渠道保障云数据中心算力供应。三星近期代工业务版图持续扩张，除谷歌外，还接连斩获特斯拉新一代AI6芯片及英伟达“维拉·鲁宾”（Vera Rubin）平台新型语言处理器的代工订单。尽管目前合作方案仍存在调整空间，但该布局反映了头部科技企业在先进制程产能争夺上的战略调整。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果软件工程主管明确新版Siri AI定位：主打高效实用，拒绝开发情感陪伴功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/54d9b10d637fb48c58e1b624a805a8e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在WWDC2026期间，苹果软件工程主管Craig Federighi明确表示，新版Siri AI将定位为高效实用工具，不会开发AI男友、AI女友等情感陪伴类功能。苹果认为，市面上部分AI产品通过建立情感联系诱导用户泄露隐私，这与苹果的设计理念相悖。作为iOS 27的核心升级，新版Siri AI具备强大的跨设备本地资料检索、全系统跨应用操作能力，并能结合屏幕内容与全网信息输出答案。若用户尝试进行情感互动，Siri将不会作出相关回应。此外，受合规要求影响，国行版iPhone目前暂无法上线Siri AI功能，具体上线时间仍需等待官方后续通知。此次定位明确了苹果在AI发展路径上的克制与侧重，即优先保障用户隐私与操作效率，而非通过虚拟社交留存用户。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯调整AI战略重心：WorkBuddy取代元宝成为核心办公智能体</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96be815c6ac81d9ff05a839af2088d38.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯近期调整AI战略，将办公场景智能体WorkBuddy确立为核心驱动力，原先的“元宝”产品退居幕后。WorkBuddy自2026年初推出以来，凭借极低的使用门槛和单句指令处理复杂任务的能力，迅速成为职场效率工具领域的黑马。数据显示，今年3月其月访问量达885万，环比增速达831%。5月23日App端上线后，下载排名迅速跻身前60名。腾讯在产品迭代上投入巨大，6月5日披露WorkBuddy个人版在三个月内完成43次版本更新，目前已被视为腾讯“混元”系列模型战略优先级最高的产品。为进一步拓宽生态，该产品正测试打通微信支付，并接入腾讯自选股专家中心，旨在将AI能力深度嵌入金融及日常办公流程，标志着腾讯已将WorkBuddy定义为AI落地应用的关键支点。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta旗下视频编辑应用Edits推出AI创作助手与桌面版</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c001c01fc04e57bb110ef06d5fdb2505.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta在洛杉矶创作者活动上宣布，旗下短视频编辑应用Edits将推出全新AI创作助手及桌面版本。该AI助手可深度打通Instagram后台数据，通过分析观看量、留存率等指标，为创作者精准推荐视频创意与热门音频，旨在减少对第三方多模态工具的依赖。全新桌面版则补齐了多轨道剪辑短板，实现与移动端的无缝同步。此外，Edits已上线“Beta”实验功能标签页及包含受众人口统计、黄金活跃时段的多维数据看板，并支持发布前的多版本成片效果测试。Meta官方数据显示，Edits生成内容的保存率与转发率分别提升10%和2%，目前Instagram上超半数Reels内容由Edits创作。此次更新不仅强化了Edits与Instagram生态的绑定，也使其在功能层面具备了与CapCut正面竞争的硬件基础，标志着AI全栖创作生态正成为短视</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic布局美国数据中心并拟寻求谷歌母公司财务支持</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b06c6223fb4fc3d3ba092df93638f676.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">人工智能企业Anthropic近期正式启动数据中心布局计划，已在美国签署十余份初步租约，总容量突破1吉瓦，并计划持续加码基础设施建设以扩大规模。在财务层面，Anthropic高管正寻求谷歌母公司Alphabet为上述数据中心租约提供财务担保。此外，市场传闻双方可能在数据中心专用芯片设计领域展开深度合作。针对上述布局及融资意向，谷歌官方表示不对市场猜测作出回应，Anthropic方面目前也未发布相关置评。此次大规模基建布局显示出Anthropic在算力资源储备上的战略提速，若获得Alphabet的财务担保及芯片设计支持，将进一步巩固其在高性能计算基础设施领域的竞争壁垒，对行业算力供给格局产生深远影响。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
